<title>POLAND: Komunalny to assimilate registered shares.</title>
<headline>Komunalny to assimilate registered shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Komunalny SA will on December 3 assimilate 56,200 registered shares into common shares for bourse trade, the bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Komunalny said the shares -- 53,100 common registered shares and 3,100 privileged registered shares -- would be converted into regular common shares by the National Securities Depository (KDPW) on December 2.</p>
<p>The bank said that after the change it would have 2,831,397 shares in bourse trade and 3,400,003 shareholder votes.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
